[[15,3,0,"<h2>Diagram for checking underbody</h2><p>This chapter is designed to highlight the typical vehicle measurements in order to work correctly when carrying out repairs and produce the best possible results. The comparative measurements, expressed in millimetres, may be subject to differences (of around 2mm) which the experienced mechanic will be able to interpret and establish whether they are due to any impact or to manufacturing tolerances.</p><h3>Diagram for checking underbody: short wheelbase</h3><p>The underbody for short wheelbase versions is illustrated in the diagram below</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244006493.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>A left front main opening</li><li>B left rear main opening</li><li>C right rear main opening</li><li>D right front main opening</li><li>1 lower front crossmember fastening</li><li>2 engine fastenings</li><li>3 shock absorber attachment mounting fastening 3 openings</li><li>4 suspension frame front fastening</li><li>5 suspension frame rear fastening</li><li>6 fuel tank centre fastening</li><li>7 fuel tank side front fastening</li><li>8 fuel tank rear fastening</li><li>9 rear suspension front fastenings</li><li>10 rear suspension rear fastenings</li><li>11 shock absorber fastening</li></ul></figure><h3>Diagram for checking underbody: medium wheelbase</h3><p>The underbody for medium wheelbase versions is illustrated in the diagram below</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244006494.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>A left front main opening</li><li>B left rear main opening</li><li>C right rear main opening</li><li>D right front main opening</li><li>1 lower front crossmember fastening</li><li>2 engine fastenings</li><li>3 shock absorber attachment mounting fastening 3 openings</li><li>4 suspension frame front fastening</li><li>5 suspension frame rear fastening</li><li>6 fuel tank centre fastening</li><li>7 fuel tank side front fastening</li><li>8 fuel tank rear fastening</li><li>9 rear suspension front fastenings</li><li>10 rear suspension rear fastenings</li><li>11 shock absorber fastening</li></ul></figure><h3>Diagram for checking underbody: long wheelbase</h3><p>The underbody for long wheelbase versions is illustrated in the diagram below</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244006495.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>A left front main opening</li><li>B left rear main opening</li><li>C right rear main opening</li><li>D right front main opening</li><li>1 lower front crossmember fastening</li><li>2 engine fastenings</li><li>3 shock absorber attachment mounting fastening 3 openings</li><li>4 suspension frame front fastening</li><li>5 suspension frame rear fastening</li><li>6 fuel tank centre fastening</li><li>7 fuel tank side front fastening</li><li>8 fuel tank rear fastening</li><li>9 rear suspension front fastenings</li><li>10 rear suspension rear fastenings</li><li>11 shock absorber fastening</li></ul></figure>"]]